OL,3,ABrand will face 'hell on earth' in
OL,4,AWandsworth prison, says former inmate
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussell Brand will face "hell on earth"
OL,7,Finside HMP Wandsworth, a former inmate
OL,8,Fat the London prison has said.
OL,10,FBrand, 51, was convicted a week ago of
OL,11,Fone count of rape and three counts of
OL,12,Fsexual assault, and was sentenced on
OL,13,FMonday to 10 years and six months in
OL,14,Fprison.
OL,16,FHe is currently being held at the South
OL,17,FLondon jail, which is one of England's
OL,18,Flargest Victorian-era prisons.
